# Parent-context seed regions. Coordinates are intentionally placeholders
# until the region seed run is accepted. Do not apply this file to signoff
# until each region is non-overlapping and the HMIC official region is checked.
#
# def_region {soc_cpu}  <xmin> <xmax> <ymin> <ymax>
# def_region {soc_ai}   <xmin> <xmax> <ymin> <ymax>
# def_region {soc_dma}  <xmin> <xmax> <ymin> <ymax>
# def_region {soc_fabric} <xmin> <xmax> <ymin> <ymax>
# def_inst_region {u_soc_core/u_cpu_partition} {soc_cpu}
# def_inst_region {u_soc_core/u_ai_partition} {soc_ai}
# def_inst_region {u_soc_core/u_dma_partition} {soc_dma}
# def_inst_region {u_soc_core/u_axi_fabric_partition} {soc_fabric}
#
# The DDR region is controlled by the PDS HMIC generator and its official
# constraints. Do not place a generic region over the DDR PHY.
